{"id":"botswana-overland","title":"Botswana: Okavango to Chobe","who":"Classic route · self-drive safari","when":"May to October (dry season, best game)","vehicle":"Equipped 4x4, 10–14 days, park campsites","kind":"4x4","color":"#4d7c0f","summary":"Salt pans and baobabs, then into the wild: Moremi on the edge of the Okavango Delta, the Khwai river, the deep sand to Savuti, and the Chobe riverfront's elephant herds. Unfenced campsites, river crossings, and park bookings made months ahead.","sources":[{"label":"Getaway: road-tripping northern Botswana","url":"https://getaway.co.za/photography/road-tripping-northern-botswana-photo-blog"},{"label":"We Will Nomad: Botswana by road, a self-drive diary","url":"https://www.wewillnomad.com/post/botswana-by-road-our-self-drive-safari-diary"}],"approximate":"The classic circuit; tracks in the parks shift with the seasons.","km":718,"bbox":[23.3531,-20.2548,26.1805,-17.7986],"stops":[{"name":"Nata","place":"Nata, Botswana","at":[-20.2107,26.1805],"text":"The edge of the Makgadikgadi pans, with flamingos in the wet season."},{"name":"Gweta","place":"Gweta, Botswana","at":[-20.209,25.2553],"text":"Baobabs and meerkats; trips onto the salt pans.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/DeltaOkawango.jpg/500px-DeltaOkawango.jpg","page":"Makgadikgadi Pan","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DeltaOkawango.jpg","credit":"The SeaWiFS Project, NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center, and ORBIMAGE","license":"Public domain"}},{"name":"Maun","place":"Maun, Botswana","at":[-19.9861,23.4224],"text":"The safari town: fuel, food, permits, and scenic flights over the Delta.","source":{"label":"Getaway: northern Botswana","url":"https://getaway.co.za/photography/road-tripping-northern-botswana-photo-blog"}},{"name":"Third Bridge","place":"Third Bridge, Moremi","at":[-19.2386,23.3531],"text":"Moremi's famous camp in the Delta, with lions and wild dogs about.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/w